5. Others

  5-1 Handling of "SMT Green Procurement Guideline"


  The Guideline is announced and revised as follows.
           (1) "SMT Green Procurement Guideline" is announced in the following SMT web site.
                http://www.suzuki.co.th/webpage/home/index.html

              (2) In the case of revision of the Guideline and "SUZUKI Controlled Chemical Substances List
                  (Appendix 1)", our Buyer or Green Procurement Promotion Section will provide all suppliers with the
                  relevant information by e-mail.
                  After revision, the revised document will become effective.


  5-2 Handling of Submitted Data


   All of the data are submitted by suppliers will be only used within SMT as confidential
information and will not be disclosed outside the company.
   It should be noted, however, such information may be provided to a governmental agency or public
environment related organizations such as certification body of each country if such a request is
made.


